{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":28.920000076293945,"text":"A small vaulted tomb, painted inside like a garden, branches, birds, flowers, light. The first Christians of Thessaloniki did not paint death, they painted a place where they wanted someone they loved to be. The walls were done in fresco, color laid onto wet plaster, which is why they lasted. The tomb was lifted out of the ground whole and brought into the museum in one piece.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"small","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"vaulted","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":2.1600000858306885},{"word":"tomb","start":2.1600000858306885,"end":2.1600000858306885},{"word":"painted","start":3,"end":3},{"word":"inside","start":3,"end":3.619999885559082},{"word":"like","start":3.619999885559082,"end":3.880000114440918},{"word":"a","start":3.880000114440918,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"garden","start":4.340000152587891,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"branches","start":5.300000190734863,"end":5.400000095367432},{"word":"birds","start":6.639999866485596,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"flowers","start":7.579999923706055,"end":7.579999923706055},{"word":"light","start":8.260000228881836,"end":8.300000190734863},{"word":"The","start":8.960000038146973,"end":9.260000228881836},{"word":"first","start":9.260000228881836,"end":9.680000305175781},{"word":"Christians","start":9.680000305175781,"end":10.0600004196167},{"word":"of","start":10.0600004196167,"end":10.479999542236328},{"word":"Thessaloniki","start":10.479999542236328,"end":10.9399995803833},{"word":"did","start":10.9399995803833,"end":11.600000381469727},{"word":"not","start":11.600000381469727,"end":11.920000076293945},{"word":"paint","start":11.920000076293945,"end":12.119999885559082},{"word":"death","start":12.119999885559082,"end":12.579999923706055},{"word":"they","start":12.739999771118164,"end":13.359999656677246},{"word":"painted","start":13.3599996